BT /F1 13 Tf 50 790 Td 17 TL (Aunt May's Chicken Pot Pie) ' (Serves 6) ' (Ingredients) ' (2 cups cooked chicken, diced) ' (1 cup frozen peas) ' (2 carrots, diced) ' (1/3 cup butter) ' (1/3 cup flour) ' (1 3/4 cups chicken broth) ' (2/3 cup milk) ' (2 pie crusts) ' (Directions) ' (1. Heat oven to 425F. Melt butter and stir in flour.) ' (2. Whisk in broth and milk and simmer until thick.) ' (3. Add chicken and vegetables, pour into crust, top and bake 30 minutes.) ' ET
endstream
endobj
