BT /F1 13 Tf 50 790 Td 17 TL (Sunday Beef Stew) ' (Serves 8) ' (Ingredients) ' (3 lbs beef chuck, cubed) ' (1/4 cup flour) ' (3 tbsp olive oil) ' (2 onions, chopped) ' (4 cloves garlic, minced) ' (6 cups beef broth) ' (2 tbsp tomato paste) ' (5 carrots, sliced) ' (6 potatoes, cubed) ' (1 tsp dried thyme) ' (Directions) ' (1. Toss the beef with flour and brown in batches in the oil.) ' ET
endstream
