BT /F1 13 Tf 50 790 Td 17 TL (Lemon Bars) ' (Makes 16) ' (Ingredients) ' (1 cup butter, softened) ' (1/2 cup sugar) ' (2 cups flour) ' (4 eggs) ' (1 1/2 cups sugar) ' (1/4 cup flour) ' (2 lemons, juiced) ' (Directions) ' (1. Press butter, sugar and flour into a pan and bake 15 minutes at 350F.) ' (2. Whisk eggs, sugar, flour and lemon juice, pour over crust and bake 20 minutes.) ' (3. Cool and dust with powdered sugar.) ' ET
endstream
