BT /F1 13 Tf 50 790 Td 17 TL (Weeknight Fried Rice) ' (Ingredients) ' (3 cups cooked rice) ' (2 eggs, beaten) ' (1 cup frozen peas and carrots) ' (3 green onions, sliced) ' (3 tbsp soy sauce) ' (1 tbsp sesame oil) ' (Method) ' (Scramble the eggs in a hot wok and set aside.) ' (Stir fry the vegetables, add rice and soy sauce, then the eggs and green onions.) ' ET
endstream
